graph TD
    A[Replication Fork] --> B[Leading Strand Synthesis]
    A --> C[Lagging Strand Synthesis]
    
    B --> D[DNA Polymerase ε]
    D --> E[Continuous DNA Synthesis]
    E --> F[Leading Strand Product]
    
    C --> G[Primase Activity]
    G --> H[RNA Primer Synthesis]
    H --> I[DNA Polymerase δ]
    I --> J[Okazaki Fragment Synthesis]
    J --> K[Fragment Extension]
    K --> L[Fragment Completion]
    L --> M[RNase H Activity]
    M --> N[RNA Primer Removal]
    N --> O[DNA Ligase I]
    O --> P[Fragment Ligation]
    P --> Q[Lagging Strand Product]
    
    F --> R[Replication Fork Progression]
    Q --> R
    R --> S[Chromatin Assembly]
    S --> T[Histone Deposition]
    T --> U[Chromatin Maturation]
    
    %% Replication stress response
    U --> V{Replication Stress?}
    V -->|Yes| W[Checkpoint Activation]
    W --> X[Replication Slowdown]
    X --> Y[Stress Resolution]
    Y --> U
    
    V -->|No| Z[Continue Replication]
    
    %% Key proteins
    AA[DNA Pol ε] --> D
    BB[DNA Pol δ] --> I
    CC[Primase] --> G
    DD[RNase H] --> M
    EE[DNA Ligase I] --> O
    FF[PCNA] --> D
    GG[PCNA] --> I
    HH[RPA] --> B
    II[RPA] --> C
    JJ[RFC] --> FF
    KK[RFC] --> GG
    
